ndon, UK</publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-wrap><fig id="fig1"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p>Kaplan&#x02013;Meier survival curve by surgeon volume.</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" mime-subtype="gif" xlink:href="94-6602894f1"/></fig><table-wrap id="tbl1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Surgeon volume and patient demographic characteristics, follow-up duration and survival</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="left"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Surgeon volume<sup>a</sup> (<italic>N</italic>)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>High (6) (&#x02a7e;50)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Medium (4) (11&#x02013;49)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Low (15) (&#x02a7d;10)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Total (25)</bold></th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Test, <italic>P</italic>-value</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Age at diagnosis (years)</italic></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Spearman's rank</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;<italic>N</italic> (&#x00025;)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2092</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">536</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">76</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2704</td><td align